==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰewbʰ-}}
From {{prefix|en|para|typhoid fever}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} Any of a variety of acute infectious intestinal diseases resembling [[typhoid fever]] but less severe, caused by eating food contaminated with certain [[bacteria]] of the genus {{taxfmt|Salmonella|genus}}.

